### 3.1 & 3.13: Get all persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### 3.2 & 3.18: Get info page
GET http://localhost:3001/info

### 3.3 & 3.18: Get single person by valid ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/64b58e72f321456789abcdef

### 3.3: Get non-existing person (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/64b58e72f321456789abcfff

### 3.16: Get person with malformatted ID (400)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/invalid-id-format

### 3.5 & 3.14: Create a new person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linus Torvalds",
  "number": "040-1234567"
}

### 3.6: Create person with missing name (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "040-1234567"
}

### 3.6: Create person with missing number (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper"
}

### 3.19: Create person with name shorter than 3 characters (Validation Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Al",
  "number": "040-1234567"
}

### 3.20: Create person with invalid number format (Validation Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan Turing",
  "number": "1234567"
}

### 3.20: Create person with invalid hyphen format (Validation Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan Turing",
  "number": "1-22334455"
}

### 3.20: Create person with multiple hyphens (Validation Error 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan Turing",
  "number": "10-22-334455"
}

### 3.17: Update existing person number
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/persons/64b58e72f321456789abcdef
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linus Torvalds",
  "number": "050-9876543"
}

### 3.4 & 3.15: Delete a person
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/64b58e72f321456789abcdef

### Unknown endpoint (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/unknown-path
